==Trivia==
*[[Kory]] is the first character to have Wave Attacks.
*[[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Gross Cat]] and [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Titan Cat]] are the first cats to have Wave Attacks.
*Enemies will create blue waves, and cats will create pink waves.
*Wave Attacks are visually and functionally similar to the blasts fired by the default [[Cat Cannon]] and Holy Blast cannon. However, Holy Blast is able to hit [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] that are immune to waves, such as [[Zapy]], whereas the default Cat Cannon can't.

